WEBVTT

01:40.770 --> 01:45.780
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.310 --> 01:50.680
[Episode 11]

01:59.460 --> 02:00.690
How are you, Hongye?

02:02.640 --> 02:03.430
Much better.

02:05.160 --> 02:06.650
Why do you think Huaizhu

02:06.710 --> 02:08.520
has become like this?

02:08.860 --> 02:11.580
Is the City Lord

02:11.610 --> 02:12.540
they mentioned

02:12.640 --> 02:14.770
the great demon who abducted Huaizhu?

02:16.000 --> 02:16.960
Why did he

02:16.960 --> 02:18.630
bring Huaizhu here?

02:19.250 --> 02:21.180
I want to know all these things too.

02:21.600 --> 02:23.460
That's why when I fought with her,

02:23.610 --> 02:24.640
I placed

02:25.000 --> 02:26.930
an eavesdropping talisman on her.

02:32.000 --> 02:33.520
The person you love

02:33.520 --> 02:36.000
doesn't recognize you and has turned into a demoness.

02:36.000 --> 02:37.280
Under such emotional stress,

02:37.280 --> 02:40.410
you were still able to place an eavesdropping talisman?

02:57.290 --> 02:58.050
My Lord.

02:59.280 --> 03:00.190
Leave.

03:01.960 --> 03:03.150
I am tired.

03:05.000 --> 03:07.800
Lord Jiuhuo must be hiding something from me.

03:09.310 --> 03:10.770
You are Dongfang Huaizhu,

03:11.200 --> 03:12.490
not some Guardian.

03:12.510 --> 03:13.770
If you don't remember,

03:14.140 --> 03:15.400
I will help you recall.

03:16.710 --> 03:20.030
Who is this Dongfang Huaizhu he mentioned?

03:35.000 --> 03:36.430
Lord Jiuhuo.

03:38.030 --> 03:39.310
You've become

03:40.560 --> 03:42.120
more fond of beauty than before.

03:42.120 --> 03:43.520
I never expected

03:43.910 --> 03:46.650
that you would comb someone's hair.

03:46.670 --> 03:49.660
When you were little, you were even wilder.

03:49.970 --> 03:51.960
Every time I fixed your hair,

03:51.960 --> 03:54.120
you'd mess it up in no time.

03:54.560 --> 03:55.710
At that time, I

03:55.870 --> 03:58.000
really wanted to shave your head bald.

03:59.870 --> 04:01.800
Are you really

04:02.190 --> 04:03.750
talking about me?

04:06.560 --> 04:07.620
You need not doubt.

04:08.170 --> 04:10.520
That mandala flower is the best proof.

04:14.400 --> 04:15.120
Today—

04:15.120 --> 04:17.190
Today, you did not come to my chamber

04:17.649 --> 04:19.480
and nothing happened.

04:20.010 --> 04:21.410
You only need to remember

04:21.680 --> 04:23.810
that I raised you since you were young.

04:24.470 --> 04:25.830
Without my protection,

04:26.200 --> 04:29.330
you would have no place among neither humans nor demons.

04:31.120 --> 04:32.490
But why

04:33.120 --> 04:35.159
can't I remember any of this?

04:43.040 --> 04:44.840
While fighting against humans,

04:45.270 --> 04:47.070
your head was severely injured,

04:47.390 --> 04:49.190
causing you to lose your memory.

04:52.400 --> 04:53.200
What's wrong?

04:54.070 --> 04:55.270
Do you doubt me?

04:56.720 --> 04:57.650
I wouldn't dare.

05:12.070 --> 05:13.430
You left the city today.

05:13.830 --> 05:15.390
Did something happen?

05:18.160 --> 05:19.430
I encountered

05:19.600 --> 05:22.130
a madman who called himself Wangquan Hongye.

05:22.270 --> 05:23.730
He said he knew me

05:24.270 --> 05:28.250
and that my name was Dongfang Huaizhu.

05:33.400 --> 05:34.590
[Eavesdropping talisman, play along]

05:38.870 --> 05:41.000
Wangquan Manor has long since fallen.

05:41.190 --> 05:42.560
There's no such person.

05:43.510 --> 05:44.950
This man is just a fraud.

05:45.720 --> 05:47.320
You needn't pay him any mind.

05:50.070 --> 05:52.120
Yes, My Lord.

05:53.430 --> 05:55.070
I have a task for you.

05:55.510 --> 05:57.750
Recently, a powerful great demon has appeared

05:57.750 --> 06:00.190
in the northwest at Lizi Hill.

06:01.040 --> 06:03.560
I want you to go and capture it for me.

06:03.270 --> 06:04.770
[Set up a trap to catch him]

06:06.390 --> 06:08.310
When should I depart?

06:12.040 --> 06:13.830
Set out early tomorrow.

06:16.990 --> 06:19.200
[Teleport to the barrier after the magical artifact is activated]

06:24.630 --> 06:25.430
Yes.

06:36.680 --> 06:38.310
This Jiuhuo

06:38.510 --> 06:40.120
combed Huaizhu's hair?

06:42.680 --> 06:45.240
Shouldn't the focus be on how she has a mission tomorrow

06:45.240 --> 06:46.190
at Lizi Hill in the northwest

06:46.190 --> 06:47.390
and can't Jiuhuo appear?

06:47.390 --> 06:48.690
He combed her hair.

06:48.720 --> 06:50.760
The tone between them is so intimate.

06:50.760 --> 06:52.159
It's only been a few days.

06:54.360 --> 06:55.540
Quzhuo said

06:56.000 --> 06:57.800
we arrived only a few hours late,

06:57.820 --> 06:58.720
but a long time

06:59.360 --> 07:01.390
should have passed in this place already.

07:01.390 --> 07:03.320
However, judging from their tone,

07:04.310 --> 07:05.600
it really doesn't seem like

07:05.600 --> 07:07.450
a relationship that could've been developed in two or three days.

07:07.450 --> 07:08.310
Right?

07:19.510 --> 07:22.710
Something else Jiuhuo just said was also very important.

07:23.690 --> 07:26.550
Wangquan Manor has long since fallen into decline.

07:28.650 --> 07:30.180
Huaizhu also mentioned it.

07:32.110 --> 07:33.770
How will it fall into decline?

07:34.190 --> 07:38.240
Will it be like Divine Fire Villa and Ruyi Pavilion?

07:39.120 --> 07:41.720
What about us?

07:42.120 --> 07:43.580
What about the Mask Group?

07:50.390 --> 07:51.000
Hongye,

07:51.750 --> 07:53.480
I want to go home and take a look.

07:53.750 --> 07:55.560
Desperate times call for desperate measures.

07:55.560 --> 07:56.750
Our primary mission

07:56.920 --> 07:58.850
is to bring Dongfang Huaizhu back.

08:00.450 --> 08:01.540
I'll find a way.

08:02.190 --> 08:05.390
Contact everyone from the Mask Group and Wangquan Manor.

08:26.530 --> 08:27.240
Zui.

08:47.440 --> 08:48.150
Plum wine?

08:49.120 --> 08:50.050
It's light wine.

08:51.820 --> 08:52.630
Not bad.

08:53.010 --> 08:54.540
You know there's a mission.

08:54.580 --> 08:55.470
Of course.

08:56.910 --> 08:57.770
Where's Yitan?

08:58.150 --> 08:59.850
He went to send messages

08:59.960 --> 09:02.490
and gather some information while he's at it.

09:02.510 --> 09:04.790
Then why didn't you go with him?

09:18.390 --> 09:19.360
Our Zui

09:19.840 --> 09:20.550
is afraid?

09:22.350 --> 09:24.390
They all say you're carefree,

09:25.870 --> 09:26.750
but actually,

09:28.270 --> 09:30.270
you understand better than anyone.

09:31.520 --> 09:32.520
Since childhood,

09:32.870 --> 09:34.270
Mother passed away early

09:34.790 --> 09:36.190
and Father went missing.

09:38.120 --> 09:39.650
You never asked me about it.

09:40.870 --> 09:42.200
When faced with rumors,

09:42.860 --> 09:44.510
you don't bring it up either.

09:46.080 --> 09:46.910
I know

09:48.240 --> 09:49.320
you care for me.

09:51.000 --> 09:52.730
You think that as your brother,

09:53.690 --> 09:55.620
I've already shouldered too much.

09:57.240 --> 09:59.150
So if in this world

10:00.410 --> 10:03.070
there was a ranking for the most understanding,

10:04.390 --> 10:05.510
then our Zui

10:07.550 --> 10:09.350
would definitely be number one.

10:10.750 --> 10:11.550
Hongye.

10:13.800 --> 10:15.070
I'm truly scared.

10:15.670 --> 10:17.330
I've already lost my parents.

10:17.840 --> 10:19.320
I'm afraid of losing you,

10:19.510 --> 10:20.790
losing Mr. Fei,

10:21.150 --> 10:23.280
and losing anyone from the Mask Group.

10:31.080 --> 10:33.270
Don't be afraid. I'm here.

10:35.000 --> 10:36.510
I will protect everyone.

10:37.510 --> 10:38.870
I will find our father.

10:40.330 --> 10:41.550
I won't let Zui

10:42.750 --> 10:44.150
lose anyone.

11:29.510 --> 11:30.790
We meet again,

11:31.390 --> 11:33.090
Wangquan Hongye.

11:36.870 --> 11:38.130
Where exactly is this?

11:38.850 --> 11:40.650
What kind of evil creature are you?

11:40.650 --> 11:42.310
I've told you,

11:42.710 --> 11:44.160
I am the Eternal Night.

11:55.770 --> 11:57.680
When the mandala flower appears

11:58.030 --> 12:01.150
is when Dongfang Huaizhu will disappear.

12:28.240 --> 12:28.910
Hongye,

12:30.120 --> 12:31.520
you had that dream again?

12:32.600 --> 12:33.200
Yes.

12:34.320 --> 12:35.920
I dreamed of that giant tree.

12:36.720 --> 12:38.390
It's getting bigger and bigger.

12:38.390 --> 12:40.120
If your speculation is correct

12:40.840 --> 12:42.510
and this tree feeds on hatred,

12:43.150 --> 12:45.630
then it should indeed be growing larger and larger

12:45.630 --> 12:47.240
because the conflict between humans and demons

12:47.240 --> 12:49.100
has reached a devastating level.

12:52.320 --> 12:53.440
What about your task?

12:53.440 --> 12:54.270
Is it all done?

12:54.750 --> 12:56.150
The news has been spread.

12:56.320 --> 12:58.320
I did some brief reconnaissance in the area.

12:58.320 --> 13:00.550
This place was originally the capital of the Netherworld Clan.

13:00.550 --> 13:03.390
The City Lord was Ye Yuan, the demon king of the Netherworld Clan.

13:03.390 --> 13:04.790
About four months ago,

13:05.270 --> 13:07.810
a celestial demon suddenly arrived in the city.

13:07.810 --> 13:09.810
He quickly became the new city lord.

13:10.550 --> 13:12.320
That must be Jiuhuo.

13:12.670 --> 13:13.670
Since then,

13:13.910 --> 13:15.910
Sky City began to accept both humans and demons,

13:15.910 --> 13:16.910
and protect them.

13:17.440 --> 13:21.100
That's why this small town outside the city gradually prospered.

13:21.320 --> 13:22.330
But why did

13:23.630 --> 13:26.230
Jiuhuo bring Huaizhu to 20 years in the future?

13:27.150 --> 13:28.440
What's his purpose?

13:29.720 --> 13:30.630
Well,

13:31.150 --> 13:32.410
that's still unknown.

13:35.290 --> 13:37.310
I am the Eternal Night.

13:40.740 --> 13:41.750
I keep feeling

13:43.220 --> 13:45.350
that he came here for this very reason.

13:47.900 --> 13:48.660
Anyway,

13:49.410 --> 13:51.810
let's deal with the Lizi Hill matter first.

13:51.960 --> 13:52.510
Alright.

14:06.600 --> 14:07.400
They're here.

14:07.600 --> 14:09.060
Including Miss Dongfang,

14:09.120 --> 14:10.450
there are seven people.

14:12.670 --> 14:14.650
[Lizi Hill]

14:28.000 --> 14:29.700
Attack your master.

14:56.670 --> 14:59.200
What exactly are your intentions towards me?

14:59.240 --> 15:00.700
Why are you so persistent?

15:01.000 --> 15:02.390
How could a mere

15:03.000 --> 15:05.630
eavesdropping talisman remain undetected for so long?

15:05.630 --> 15:07.160
Lizi Hill in the northwest.

15:07.440 --> 15:09.700
The time and place were given so clearly.

15:09.750 --> 15:11.320
It was obviously a trap.

15:11.910 --> 15:13.790
Then how could your Lord Jiuhuo ensure

15:13.790 --> 15:15.560
that we, who have fallen into the trap,

15:15.560 --> 15:17.160
would certainly be subdued?

15:17.780 --> 15:19.510
There's only one possibility.

15:19.610 --> 15:21.030
He gave you a magical artifact

15:21.030 --> 15:22.600
that can subdue enemies...

15:28.670 --> 15:29.440
in one move.

15:32.600 --> 15:33.930
Those who worry too much

15:34.080 --> 15:35.260
are prone to premature aging.

15:35.260 --> 15:37.060
You are so handsome and elegant.

15:37.360 --> 15:39.360
Be careful not to get gray hair.

15:40.450 --> 15:41.140
Yitan,

15:41.390 --> 15:42.200
see what it is.

15:52.110 --> 15:54.040
This is a teleportation artifact.

15:54.200 --> 15:57.020
The destination seems to have been carefully designed.

15:57.020 --> 16:00.220
You can't afford to offend Lord Jiuhuo.

16:00.440 --> 16:02.000
If you obediently let me go,

16:02.600 --> 16:04.660
you might still have a chance to live.

16:06.120 --> 16:07.180
It's not just that.

16:08.110 --> 16:09.270
Your Lord Jiuhuo

16:09.750 --> 16:11.810
must be monitoring the scene, right?

16:13.390 --> 16:15.790
I have a message for him.

16:20.560 --> 16:22.790
I will definitely take Huaizhu back.

16:22.810 --> 16:24.610
No matter what you're planning,

16:25.080 --> 16:26.360
it won't succeed.

16:27.250 --> 16:28.460
Interesting.

16:30.410 --> 16:33.460
I'll come to meet you right now.

16:44.270 --> 16:45.870
Young Master Wangquan.

16:48.150 --> 16:50.980
Does this Miss Dongfang Huaizhu you speak of

16:51.010 --> 16:52.920
look very similar to me

16:52.940 --> 16:54.420
and broke your heart?

16:55.380 --> 16:56.380
What do you think?

16:58.060 --> 16:59.440
Even so,

16:59.790 --> 17:00.870
you shouldn't be obsessed with me,

17:00.870 --> 17:02.800
someone who merely looks like her.

17:02.820 --> 17:04.170
Listen to my advice.

17:04.349 --> 17:05.880
It's not too late to turn back.

17:05.880 --> 17:07.310
Being so persistent

17:08.069 --> 17:09.200
is unnecessary.

17:21.920 --> 17:22.510
Hongye.

17:23.750 --> 17:24.589
I got it.

17:31.750 --> 17:34.310
Huaizhu really doesn't remember us at all.

17:34.830 --> 17:36.430
She might not remember here,

17:36.600 --> 17:40.000
but it might be different when we return to Divine Fire Villa.

17:41.050 --> 17:41.850
Let's begin.

17:57.460 --> 17:58.890
Wangquan Hongye,

17:59.590 --> 18:01.270
I admit you're very clever,

18:01.770 --> 18:02.870
but do you know

18:03.590 --> 18:05.520
that in the face of absolute power,

18:05.830 --> 18:09.420
all schemes are worthless?

18:09.790 --> 18:12.440
I don't like to personally kill people,

18:13.000 --> 18:15.440
but today I'll make an exception for you.

18:38.090 --> 18:38.890
Yitan,

18:38.910 --> 18:39.940
take Zui and go.

18:40.030 --> 18:40.510
Hongye!

18:40.530 --> 18:41.250
Quickly!

18:42.870 --> 18:43.490
Go!

18:47.680 --> 18:49.280
I understand your strength,

18:49.550 --> 18:52.450
but strategy is also part of one's strength.

19:17.400 --> 19:18.200
Don't worry.

19:18.830 --> 19:20.690
Hongye always plans thoroughly.

19:20.830 --> 19:22.110
If he told us to leave first,

19:22.110 --> 19:23.570
he must have a backup plan.

19:26.030 --> 19:27.290
Since we can't go back,

19:29.240 --> 19:30.830
let's infiltrate Sky City

19:31.000 --> 19:33.030
and find out what Jiuhuo is really up to.

19:33.030 --> 19:33.590
Alright.

19:40.190 --> 19:42.390
[Mount Xuankong]

19:46.350 --> 19:47.350
A barrier.

20:07.220 --> 20:08.610
Jiuhuo sent me here

20:08.630 --> 20:10.240
to put me in mortal danger.

20:10.270 --> 20:11.200
Neither of us

20:11.200 --> 20:12.110
can get out.

20:18.350 --> 20:19.590
Since we can't leave,

20:20.070 --> 20:23.310
why don't we think of a solution together?

20:58.880 --> 20:59.830
Tell me,

21:00.280 --> 21:02.410
where is Lord Jiuhuo's

21:02.960 --> 21:03.830
room?

21:21.270 --> 21:22.800
There's the smell of blood.

21:51.740 --> 21:53.930
The demonic aura is strong in the main hall.

21:53.930 --> 21:56.190
The Clairvoyance can't see clearly yet.

21:56.590 --> 21:57.920
Jiuhuo should be there.

21:58.310 --> 22:00.640
This room has no surveillance mechanisms

22:01.110 --> 22:02.310
or magic formations.

22:20.200 --> 22:21.200
I heard

22:21.550 --> 22:25.150
the Left Guardian is also trapped in the Mount Xuankong Barrier.

22:25.590 --> 22:26.990
Are you happy about that?

22:27.000 --> 22:27.960
I wouldn't dare.

22:28.890 --> 22:31.920
There's no way out of the Mount Xuankong Barrier.

22:32.320 --> 22:34.110
You need to find a solution quickly.

22:34.110 --> 22:35.750
The person I chose

22:36.660 --> 22:38.520
won't be so incompetent.

22:42.830 --> 22:45.090
The repair progress is behind schedule.

22:45.270 --> 22:46.410
Within 10 days,

22:46.570 --> 22:49.790
we must gather a thousand pieces of Golden Dawn fragments.

22:49.790 --> 22:51.400
My Lord, please rest assured.

22:51.400 --> 22:52.600
We'll make it in time.

22:52.960 --> 22:54.440
The breeding ground has completed

22:54.440 --> 22:57.640
the refinement of the last batch of Golden Dawn fragments

22:58.440 --> 23:00.700
It will be delivered in the next few days.

23:05.270 --> 23:06.070
My Lord.

23:07.200 --> 23:08.880
Is the food ready?

23:08.920 --> 23:10.030
It will be prepared immediately

23:10.030 --> 23:11.690
and brought to you right away.

23:11.880 --> 23:12.790
You may leave.

23:13.510 --> 23:15.350
I want to be alone for a while.

23:16.030 --> 23:16.790
Yes.

23:31.830 --> 23:34.960
The treasures and spells this demon studies

23:35.480 --> 23:37.000
are truly exquisite.

23:45.550 --> 23:48.050
The register of great demons entering the city?

23:48.050 --> 23:52.230
[Blind Bear, Gold-Water Red Monkey, Four-Legged Snake]

23:53.440 --> 23:54.200
Yitan,

23:54.640 --> 23:55.700
take a look at this.

24:04.960 --> 24:08.060
[Six-Winged Golden Bird, Pure Fire Red Fox, Peony Demon]

24:08.830 --> 24:09.830
It might be a clue.

24:12.550 --> 24:13.240
Yitan.

24:13.750 --> 24:15.830
As the saying goes, capture the leader first.

24:15.830 --> 24:17.030
Since we're already here,

24:17.030 --> 24:19.200
why don't we set up an ambush

24:19.400 --> 24:20.600
and confront Jiuhuo?

24:20.830 --> 24:23.310
We've witnessed Jiuhuo's demonic power.

24:23.680 --> 24:25.080
Even with a sneak attack,

24:25.750 --> 24:27.280
we might not stand a chance.

24:48.190 --> 24:49.180
Right Guardian,

24:49.310 --> 24:50.590
there's been an incident.

24:50.590 --> 24:53.450
A leech demon has escaped from the breeding ground.

24:54.070 --> 24:56.270
How could such a major oversight occur?

24:59.280 --> 25:00.790
Notify everyone immediately.

25:00.790 --> 25:03.070
The entire city is to search for that leech demon.

25:03.070 --> 25:04.240
Time is running out.

25:05.510 --> 25:07.510
Even if it's just one piece missing,

25:07.550 --> 25:09.550
the Golden Dawn cannot be repaired.

25:10.000 --> 25:10.750
Go find it quickly.

25:10.750 --> 25:12.640
Yes, I'll take care of it right away.

25:12.640 --> 25:13.110
Wait.

25:15.790 --> 25:17.960
What about the food the lord requested?

25:17.960 --> 25:20.440
It should be delivered soon.

25:24.350 --> 25:26.620
Can't you even handle such a small task?

25:26.880 --> 25:29.280
Is it because if Lord Jiuhuo becomes angry,

25:29.350 --> 25:30.310
it's my life he wants,

25:30.310 --> 25:31.240
not yours?

25:31.240 --> 25:32.170
I wouldn't dare.

25:32.310 --> 25:34.030
I'll go and hurry them up immediately.

25:34.030 --> 25:34.830
Forget it.

25:35.880 --> 25:37.140
I'll go find it myself.

25:46.510 --> 25:49.200
What secrets does Sky City hold?

25:50.140 --> 25:52.340
Let's go and find the leech demon first.

25:57.440 --> 25:58.070
He's here.

25:58.460 --> 25:59.120
Don't move.

26:14.350 --> 26:15.880
You dare to hide from me with

26:15.920 --> 26:18.590
a mere invisibility talisman?

26:32.310 --> 26:33.550
So it's you two?

26:34.630 --> 26:35.560
Just passing by.

26:52.510 --> 26:53.880
Left sword circles, right sword sinks.

26:53.880 --> 26:55.740
Left stab, right side step, flip.

27:04.350 --> 27:05.440
Interesting.

27:06.030 --> 27:08.200
I have food for tonight.

27:08.220 --> 27:10.000
Since you'll die for me,

27:10.110 --> 27:12.100
I'll remember your faces.

27:12.270 --> 27:12.920
Yitan.

27:12.920 --> 27:13.450
Retreat.

27:14.680 --> 27:16.010
Can you really retreat?

27:49.820 --> 27:50.450
Let's go!

28:06.480 --> 28:08.150
In such a short time,

28:09.140 --> 28:11.750
you've actually figured out my demonic aura

28:11.970 --> 28:14.300
and temporarily learned my demonic arts.

28:17.050 --> 28:18.380
Interesting.

28:19.890 --> 28:21.310
You people

28:22.510 --> 28:24.710
are becoming more and more intriguing.

28:31.510 --> 28:33.760
This flower is identical to the one on your forehead.

28:33.760 --> 28:35.290
What kind of flower is this?

28:36.570 --> 28:37.780
Mandala flower.

28:38.000 --> 28:38.960
Mandala flower?

28:40.780 --> 28:42.580
When the Mandala flower appears

28:42.590 --> 28:45.650
is when Dongfang Huaizhu disappears.

28:47.880 --> 28:51.380
Are you really talking about me?

28:52.240 --> 28:53.300
You need not doubt.

28:54.200 --> 28:56.650
That mandala flower is the best proof.

28:56.740 --> 28:58.690
To Jiuhuo, this mark

28:59.590 --> 29:01.590
seems to hold some special meaning.

29:03.550 --> 29:06.010
Was this mark drawn on you by Jiuhuo himself?

29:08.240 --> 29:09.590
I was born with it.

29:10.640 --> 29:11.690
Don't believe me?

29:11.830 --> 29:12.750
Take a look.

29:18.240 --> 29:19.550
Excuse me.

29:20.200 --> 29:22.830
Sorry for interrupting your pleasant conversation.

29:22.830 --> 29:24.400
Allow me to introduce myself.

29:24.400 --> 29:26.780
[Jia Lan, Young Fox Demon]

29:24.480 --> 29:27.000
I am the master of this Mount Xuankong Barrier,

29:27.000 --> 29:28.200
the fox demon Jia Lan.

29:33.880 --> 29:36.000
You two are pleasant on the eyes.

29:36.000 --> 29:37.030
I am

29:37.030 --> 29:38.550
in a better mood already.

29:39.430 --> 29:40.700
You're a fox demon.

29:40.790 --> 29:42.200
Are you from Tushan?

29:42.720 --> 29:44.080
Why are you here?

29:44.240 --> 29:46.200
I'm Lord Jiuhuo's disciple.

29:48.850 --> 29:50.200
Your Lord Jiuhuo

29:50.480 --> 29:52.940
often sends people here to keep you company?

29:53.480 --> 29:54.810
Where are those people?

29:55.640 --> 29:57.440
You sure have a lot of questions.

29:58.880 --> 30:00.510
Let me tell you a secret.

30:01.440 --> 30:02.850
In six hours,

30:03.030 --> 30:06.110
this Mount Xuankong will be filled with poisonous mist.

30:06.110 --> 30:08.480
The kind that not even a mosquito can escape from.

30:08.480 --> 30:10.590
See? I even told you this.

30:10.750 --> 30:13.110
Aren't I kind and adorable?

30:15.350 --> 30:17.750
So they were all poisoned to death.

30:18.350 --> 30:20.320
Dear, when you talk like that,

30:20.400 --> 30:21.960
it's not fun at all.

30:22.200 --> 30:23.930
They didn't play the game well,

30:24.200 --> 30:25.730
so of course they had to die.

30:26.750 --> 30:29.200
Then what counts as playing well?

30:29.510 --> 30:31.880
Winning against me counts as playing well.

30:31.880 --> 30:34.270
If we win, we can leave?

30:34.640 --> 30:36.830
Sure, you two can try.

30:42.510 --> 30:43.240
My Lord,

30:43.550 --> 30:46.200
do you want to bring her out?

30:47.720 --> 30:49.480
Don't you hate her?

30:50.110 --> 30:52.310
Why do you suddenly care about her life?

30:52.790 --> 30:53.750
I wouldn't dare.

30:55.240 --> 30:57.790
I know you must have many questions.

30:58.790 --> 30:59.960
Who is she?

31:00.550 --> 31:02.350
Why did I activate the magic formation

31:02.350 --> 31:04.410
to bring her 20 years into the future?

31:05.550 --> 31:06.830
I can only tell you

31:07.440 --> 31:09.770
that there is someone very important to me

31:10.020 --> 31:12.750
who is sealed outside the human and demon realms.

31:12.960 --> 31:14.590
To save her,

31:15.200 --> 31:16.750
two things must be done.

31:16.960 --> 31:18.440
Repair the Golden Dawn,

31:18.590 --> 31:20.370
and after adding in my demonic energy,

31:20.370 --> 31:23.270
I can break the barrier and bring her back.

31:23.680 --> 31:24.880
And the second thing?

31:26.070 --> 31:28.050
Is it related to the Left Guardian?

31:28.310 --> 31:29.590
The Left Guardian

31:30.310 --> 31:32.270
is the necessary condition

31:32.270 --> 31:33.800
to bring her back to my side.

31:33.880 --> 31:35.350
I observed the stars.

31:35.640 --> 31:37.750
This year's celestial phenomena are unusual.

31:37.750 --> 31:40.410
The Seven-Star Alignment will last for a month.

31:40.830 --> 31:42.200
During this month,

31:42.550 --> 31:45.440
the power of the sealing barrier will be at its weakest.

31:45.440 --> 31:47.760
So I activated the formation

31:47.880 --> 31:49.750
to bring her from 20 years ago.

31:49.970 --> 31:51.370
As for the Left Guardian,

31:51.790 --> 31:53.590
her mandala flower has bloomed.

31:53.680 --> 31:55.240
She absolutely cannot

31:55.240 --> 31:57.570
be trapped in the Mount Xuankong Barrier.

31:59.400 --> 32:01.110
Wangquan Hongye,

32:02.920 --> 32:04.780
you risked your life to come here,

32:05.070 --> 32:07.300
only to die at the hands of your beloved.

32:07.400 --> 32:08.920
This feeling

32:09.310 --> 32:11.350
must be wonderful, right?

32:13.270 --> 32:14.750
After causing chaos in Sky City

32:14.750 --> 32:16.950
and attempting to assassinate Jiuhuo,

32:17.030 --> 32:18.480
we can only find shelter

32:19.440 --> 32:21.110
in this abandoned hut.

32:24.880 --> 32:26.830
I wonder how my brother and Huaizhu

32:26.830 --> 32:28.070
are doing now.

32:31.790 --> 32:32.750
Yitan!

32:37.830 --> 32:39.620
Did you overuse your Clairvoyance

32:39.620 --> 32:41.820
when fighting against Jiuhuo just now?

32:44.260 --> 32:45.040
I think so.

32:45.880 --> 32:46.590
But Zui,

32:47.210 --> 32:48.200
I'm a bit hungry.

32:48.480 --> 32:49.750
Could you get me something to eat?

32:49.750 --> 32:50.310
Okay.

33:09.330 --> 33:11.620
[Bone-Piercing Grass] [Wick Grass]

33:20.350 --> 33:21.510
Yang Yitan,

33:22.500 --> 33:24.100
you're really troublesome.

33:36.570 --> 33:38.030
I knew something was wrong with you.

33:38.030 --> 33:40.090
You're hiding your injuries from me.

33:41.070 --> 33:41.920
I'm fine.

33:42.920 --> 33:44.050
It's just a scratch.

33:44.440 --> 33:46.350
The wound is only as big as a fingernail.

33:46.350 --> 33:47.200
Really?

33:47.350 --> 33:48.110
Really.

33:48.750 --> 33:50.750
If you don't believe me, take a look.

33:54.240 --> 33:54.880
Let me see.

34:04.350 --> 34:05.110
I'll do it.

34:06.800 --> 34:07.600
Okay.

34:08.190 --> 34:10.429
Zui, tie it tightly.

34:10.590 --> 34:13.320
Such a small wound doesn't need all this, does it?

34:14.270 --> 34:15.800
We're facing a great enemy.

34:15.920 --> 34:17.000
It's better to be cautious.

34:17.000 --> 34:17.550
Alright.

34:27.510 --> 34:28.510
Does it hurt a lot?

34:42.360 --> 34:43.159
It's done.

35:04.360 --> 35:05.280
What's wrong?

35:09.190 --> 35:11.830
Your hair just touched my nose.

35:13.000 --> 35:13.930
It's a bit itchy.

35:24.780 --> 35:26.500
You still don't look well.

35:26.520 --> 35:29.320
Is there anywhere else that feels uncomfortable?

35:31.170 --> 35:32.770
I'm just feeling a bit dizzy.

35:39.190 --> 35:39.850
Don't move.

36:00.730 --> 36:02.190
Your forehead's a bit hot.

36:11.090 --> 36:12.460
I'm just a bit tired.

36:13.560 --> 36:15.220
I'll be fine after a short nap.

36:19.100 --> 36:19.880
Yitan?

36:20.390 --> 36:21.210
Yitan!

36:23.630 --> 36:25.230
Since we're going to gamble,

36:25.360 --> 36:26.560
there must be stakes.

36:27.070 --> 36:28.070
I'll be the banker.

36:28.070 --> 36:29.360
Every time I win,

36:29.480 --> 36:31.190
you have to

36:31.190 --> 36:33.210
remove one item from each other.

36:33.440 --> 36:36.170
The one who ends up naked dies, okay?

36:36.630 --> 36:39.480
How can we win?

36:39.630 --> 36:42.070
Winning against me once counts as a win.

36:42.550 --> 36:44.000
I'm so nice, right?

36:46.480 --> 36:47.320
Let's begin.

36:56.360 --> 36:58.630
For this round, let's compare

36:58.760 --> 37:00.290
who has the smaller number.

37:02.480 --> 37:03.190
Open.

37:11.960 --> 37:12.990
You lost.

37:13.190 --> 37:14.120
This isn't fair.

37:14.190 --> 37:16.850
You're talking about fairness with the banker?

37:17.190 --> 37:19.320
Accept your loss. Take something off.

37:47.240 --> 37:48.460
Let's continue.

37:48.670 --> 37:50.360
Miss, it's your turn.

37:50.510 --> 37:52.370
What are we betting on this round?

37:52.440 --> 37:54.500
Let's bet on whether my tongue

37:54.670 --> 37:56.480
can touch my nose.

37:57.670 --> 37:59.200
I won't fall for that.

37:59.400 --> 38:00.590
You're a fox.

38:00.710 --> 38:01.740
If I say you can't,

38:01.840 --> 38:03.650
you'll definitely show me right away that you can.

38:03.650 --> 38:04.780
If I say you can,

38:04.880 --> 38:07.190
you'll pretend that you can't.

38:07.670 --> 38:08.760
I admit defeat.

38:49.340 --> 38:51.090
People often say

38:51.120 --> 38:54.000
the one who falls in love first is destined to lose.

38:54.020 --> 38:55.140
This young man

38:55.170 --> 38:56.360
is beyond saving.
